creatures:
- name: Rust Monster
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 33 (rollable(dice=6d8 + 6,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=2)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Iron Scent.*** The rust monster can pinpoint the location of ferrous metal within 30 feet of itself.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The rust monster makes one Bite attack and uses Antennae twice.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+1,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

      ***Antennae.*** The rust monster targets one nonmagical metal object—armor or a weapon—worn or carried by a creature within 5 feet of itself. *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 11, the creature with the object. *Failure:* The object takes a -1 penalty to the AC it offers (armor) or to its attack rolls (weapon). Armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10, and a weapon is destroyed if its penalty reaches -5. The penalty can be removed by casting the [Mending](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619033-mending) spell on the armor or weapon.

      ***Destroy Metal.*** The rust monster touches a nonmagical metal object within 5 feet of itself that isn't being worn or carried. The touch destroys a 1-foot ***Cube*** of the object.

      ## Reactions

      ***Reflexive Antennae.*** *Trigger:* An attack roll hits the rust monster. *Response:* The rust monster uses Antennae.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
